TestControlRecordingReplaysAgainstCreatedReceiver records object creation, a button and an input setter, then replays the generated test against the recreated receiver while leaving the original unchanged.
TestControlRecordingPreservesOverridesAndReportsMetadataErrors verifies metadata failure surfaces without suppressing the real action or exporting a misleading record; custom invoke overrides retain their original message.
TestControlRecordingNormalizesWiring verifies standard Wiring buttons export a run message to the graph.
TestControlRecordingCapturesBindingBeforeActionChangesIt checks an action that changes its own selector records the original message and arguments.
